Nernst form E_{\text{cell}} = E^{\circ} - \frac{0.059}{2} \log \frac{[\text{Zn}^{2+}]}{[\text{Cu}^{2+}]}
Ratio = \frac{0.1}{0.01} = 10 gives \log 10 = 1, so E_{\text{cell}} = 1.10 - 0.0295 = 1.0705 \text{ V}
